            "avatar_alignment": "top",
            "author_1": "Amira H.",
            "text_1": "<p>I've had KP on the backs of my arms my whole life and honestly stopped trying to fix it. A month of using this after every shower and the bumps are so much less noticeable. First short sleeves I've worn in years.</p>",
            "author_2": "Rania K.",
            "text_2": "<p>Scrubs left my legs red and raw, and plain lotion did nothing at all. This is the first thing that's gentle and actually works. It sinks in fast enough that I can get dressed straight after.</p>",
            "author_3": "Dana S.",
            "text_3": "<p>The little dark dots on my legs after shaving were the thing I hated most. They're much softer now, and my skin isn't dried out the way exfoliating products usually leave it. On my second tube.</p>",
