    "straw_testimonials": {
      "type": "ds-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "review_1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I'd Given Up On My Thighs",
            "text": "<h5>Dry brushing, exfoliating mitts, three different scrubs — nothing touched the bumps on my thighs. This is the first thing where I can run my hand over my skin and feel a difference. It took about three weeks before I noticed.</h5>",
            "author": "Yasmin A."
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Bought It For My Daughter, Kept One",
            "text": "<h5>My teenager was self-conscious about the bumps on her arms before summer. Two tubes later she's stopped mentioning it, and I've started using it on my own legs. It doesn't sting or smell medicated, which is why she actually keeps up with it.</h5>",
            "author": "Salma T."
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Be Patient With It",
            "text": "<h5>Nothing happened in the first week and I nearly gave up. Week three was when my legs started looking clearer, and by week five the difference was obvious in photos. Worth sticking with — just don't expect overnight.</h5>",
            "author": "Noor F."
          }
        }
      },
